sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Editor as Editor / Admin
    participant UI as TeamBrowser / TaskReviewUploadSection
    participant Eng as uploadEngine (upload-engine.ts)
    participant API as Route /api/review/uploads/* (withReviewRoute)
    participant Svc as upload-service.ts
    participant DB as Prisma / Neon
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2
    participant Mux as Mux
    participant WH as POST /api/webhooks/mux
    participant Ing as Inngest (/api/inngest)

    Editor->>UI: chọn hoặc kéo-thả file video
    UI->>Eng: uploadEngine.enqueue(file, target)
    Eng->>Eng: validateFileMeta + sniffContent (magic bytes)
    alt file lỗi (EMPTY / UNSUPPORTED_TYPE / TOO_LARGE / BAD_CONTENT)
        Eng-->>UI: status failed, không gọi server
    else file hợp lệ
        Eng->>API: POST initiate hoặc task-upload/initiate (Idempotency-Key)
        API->>Svc: initiateUpload / initiateTaskUpload
        Svc->>Svc: requireReviewAccess(workspaceId)
        alt chưa đăng nhập hoặc sai workspace
            Svc-->>Eng: 401 UNAUTHORIZED / 403 FORBIDDEN (ReviewAccessError)
        else body sai schema hoặc file không nhận
            Svc-->>Eng: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR / 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE / 413 FILE_TOO_LARGE
        else task-upload nhưng editor không phải assignee
            Svc-->>Eng: 403 FORBIDDEN (chỉ bàn giao task được giao)
        else OK
            Svc->>DB: create ReviewAsset + ReviewVersion (pipelineStatus UPLOADING) + UploadSession
            Svc->>R2: createMultipart + presignUploadPart x N
            Svc-->>Eng: 201 uploadSessionId + danh sách presigned part URL
        end
    end

    loop từng part (4 part/file, 8 in-flight, retry tối đa 5 lần backoff)
        Eng->>R2: XHR PUT part trực tiếp lên R2
        R2-->>Eng: 200 + ETag
    end
    alt part trả 403 (presigned URL hết hạn)
        Eng->>API: re-initiate cùng Idempotency-Key để re-sign URL
    else part lỗi mạng / 5xx quá 5 lần
        Eng-->>UI: failFile NETWORK, hiện nút Thử lại
    end

    Eng->>API: POST uploads/:uploadSessionId/complete kèm parts + etags
    API->>Svc: completeUpload(uploadSessionId, parts)
    Svc->>DB: claim atomic UPLOADING sang UPLOADED (updateMany)
    Svc->>R2: completeMultipart hoặc headObject (single-part)
    alt R2 finalize lỗi
        Svc->>DB: revertFinalizeClaim UPLOADED về UPLOADING
        Svc-->>Eng: 502 UPSTREAM_ERROR (provider r2)
    else dung lượng thật vượt cap (headObject)
        Svc->>R2: deleteObject
        Svc->>DB: ReviewVersion FAILED
        Svc-->>Eng: 413 FILE_TOO_LARGE
    else session hết hạn / đã abort
        Svc-->>Eng: 410 UPLOAD_EXPIRED / 409 STATE_INVALID
    else OK
        Svc->>DB: UploadSession.completedAt + driveCompletion
        Note over Svc,DB: IMAGE sang READY ngay, VIDEO sang PROCESSING
        Svc->>Ing: inngest.send review/upload.completed (chỉ video)
        Svc-->>Eng: uploadStatus processing hoặc ready
    end

    loop poll 3s tối đa 1h
        Eng->>API: GET uploads/:uploadSessionId (getUploadStatus)
        API-->>Eng: uploadStatus + version DTO
    end

    Ing->>Ing: reviewProcessUpload, step verify-content (magic bytes từ R2)
    alt nội dung không phải video
        Ing->>DB: ReviewVersion FAILED (magic-bytes)
    else OK
        Ing->>R2: ensureColorTaggedInput + presignGetObject 24h
        Ing->>Mux: createMuxAsset(inputUrl, passthrough = versionId)
        Mux-->>Ing: muxAssetId
        Ing->>DB: lưu muxAssetId (guard PROCESSING + null)
    end

    Mux->>WH: webhook video.asset.ready hoặc video.asset.errored (Mux-Signature)
    alt chữ ký HMAC sai hoặc lệch quá 5 phút
        WH-->>Mux: 401 invalid signature (Mux sẽ retry)
    else JSON hỏng
        WH-->>Mux: 400 bad json
    else hợp lệ
        WH->>DB: WebhookEvent.create (P2002 trùng thì ack, không refire)
        WH->>Ing: inngest.send review/mux.event.received
        WH-->>Mux: 200 ok
    end

    Ing->>DB: reviewMuxWebhook, step load-event (ledger WebhookEvent)
    alt đã processedAt (duplicate)
        Ing->>Ing: skip
    else video.asset.ready
        Ing->>DB: applyMuxReady, flip PROCESSING sang READY + currentVersionId + notify uploader
    else video.asset.errored
        Ing->>DB: applyMuxErrored, flip sang FAILED + errorMessage
    end
    Ing->>DB: mark WebhookEvent.processedAt

    Eng->>API: poll thấy ready
    Eng-->>UI: status done, card Sẵn sàng để review

